From: tobific <tobific@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] seam: owner-bound service-tier policy (experimental)

Adds agent/service_tier_policy.py and a PluginContext mixin
(register_service_tier_policy). A profile-selected plugin callback decides
"normal" or "priority" per request; the decision is bound to the request
owner (gateway turn, delegation child, cron job, background review) and is
re-evaluated when the route changes. fast_mode, turn_api_call,
background_review and delegate_tool consult it. The orchestrator's
native_worker/tier_authority use capture_request_owner and _Decision.

Experimental, built against Hermes 8a3ede1b.
